This license covers Super Metroid DS's own code. Two things it doesn't cover:

- The SNES core (sm-core-a.so / sm-core-b.so in the builds) is snes9x's
  libretro core, under the snes9x license (licenses/snes9x-LICENSE.txt in the
  builds): free for non-commercial use only. The builds of Super Metroid DS
  therefore may only be distributed and used for non-commercial purposes. The
  core's two additions in core/ (smds_ext.cpp, ntsc_stub.cpp) are MIT like the
  rest of this project.
- Third-party files keep their own terms: the stb headers in src/
  (stb_image.h, stb_image_write.h, stb_truetype.h; public domain or MIT),
  src/libretro.h (MIT, the libretro API), and the Super Metroid font in
  assets/fonts.
